  <div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">01</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Every product title follows the same template, with no real keywords.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">02</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Collection pages have a logo and a grid of products, and nothing else.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">03</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">You rank for your brand name, but not for what you sell.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span class="red label" style="min-width:34px">04</span><p class="p" style="font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)">Titles and descriptions are missing, duplicated or cut off in search results.</p></div></div>
