<section data-expansion style="padding:0 0 130px"><div class="narrow">
<h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);margin:0 0 28px;max-width:860px">How product and collection pages should read</h2>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">Product and collection pages are where most sales happen, and they're often the weakest pages on a store. The titles are generic, the descriptions are missing and the copy is copied from the supplier. Search engines can't tell what the page is for, and neither can the buyer.</p>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">What a strong product page includes</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 26px;padding-left:22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink2)"><li style="margin:0 0 8px">A title that names the product and states its use.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">A description that tells the buyer what they get.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">An opening paragraph that answers the most common question.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Specifications in a clear list, with the details buyers search for.</li><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Images with descriptive alt text, and reviews where you have them.</li></ul>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">What a strong collection page includes</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">A short introduction that says what the collection is for and who it suits. A clear heading. Links to the buying guides that help people choose. And a product grid that is easy to scan on a phone.</p>
<p class="label red" style="margin:36px 0 14px">How we work</p>
<p class="p" style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px">We start with the pages that sell the most, or should. We rewrite titles, descriptions and copy, check the result on phones and desktops, and track how each page performs.</p>
<h3 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(32px,3.6vw,44px);margin:56px 0 24px">Frequently asked questions</h3>
<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink);margin:0 0 20px"><details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0"><summary style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer">Will you rewrite all our products?</summary><p class="p" style="margin:14px 0 0">Not at once. We start with the most important pages and extend the work once the results are measured.</p></details><details style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0"><summary style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer">Do you use the supplier's product copy?</summary><p class="p" style="margin:14px 0 0">We use it as a source of facts, but we rewrite it so the page isn't identical to every other store selling the same product.</p></details></div>
</div></section>
